.   nbreg mental_poor dd_treatment `X' if educ <= 2, cluster(fips) // Effect on Mental 
> Health
. 
.   nbreg phys_poor dd_treatment `X' if educ <= 2, cluster(fips) // Effect on Physical 
> health
. }

